 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, what's up? How are you doing?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.79,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_24",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm fine, thanks for asking.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.67,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_15"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is it worth getting a touchscreen laptop?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "laptop_buying.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It depends. If you like drawing or taking handwritten notes, yes. For typing and browsing, most people barely use it.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.91,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "laptop_buying.dlg2",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I do take a lot of notes in meetings.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 1.16,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "laptop_buying.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then a two in one with a stylus could be really handy. You can fold it flat like a notepad.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.72,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "laptop_buying.dlg2",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Wait, that can't be right.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.88,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_12",
   "block": "laptop_buying.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "I'm fairly sure about it, but I could be wrong. What sounds off to you?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.71,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "laptop_buying.dlg2",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Do those break more easily, with the",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.1,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "laptop_buying.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "folding hinge and everything?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.0,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "laptop_buying.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Good ones are pretty sturdy these days. Just read reviews about the hinge before you buy.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "laptop_buying.dlg2",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And does the touchscreen drain the battery?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.8,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "laptop_buying.dlg2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A little, but not much. The screen brightness matters a lot more than the touch part.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 1.74,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "laptop_buying.dlg2",
   "reference_only": true
  }
